	(text "PORT 4 DECODE AND STROBES" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cfea6eb7-d407-55ac-af15-dabe73795544"))
	(text "U1 decodes N0-N2: PORT4_L is low through an INP 4 / OUT 4. OUT 4: OUTCLK = NAND(port 4, -MRD low, TPB) (U5A)\nclocks the 74HCT374 as TPB ends. INP 4 or this card's DMA: the 74HCT244 drives the bus while -MRD is high (U6A, U6B)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2a9dbfea-abf3-5fc1-ae73-133f4b1cbed0"))
